      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHY A 6TH SURFACE — \"two readers, one canon\" was really N readers, N canons",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHY A 6TH SURFACE — \"two readers, one canon\" was really N readers, N canons",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el88",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 58,
      "y": 1008,
      "width": 1186.9,
      "height": 19,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1088,
      "index": "a088",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 88,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "updated": 1776053089758,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The five in-repo surfaces (canon · PR rules · architecture review · procedures · deep context) stay per-repo and unchanged. The OKL holds only the cross-repo subset —",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The five in-repo surfaces (canon · PR rules · architecture review · procedures · deep context) stay per-repo and unchanged. The OKL holds only the cross-repo subset —",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "el89",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 58,
      "y": 1030,
      "width": 1115.4,
      "height": 19,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#334155",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1089,
      "index": "a089",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "seed": 89,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "updated": 1776053089758,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "org-scoped world-facts — enforced fail-closed at task time, the way the mechanical gates enforce at merge time. Repo quirks stay repo-scoped and never leak.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "org-scoped world-facts — enforced fail-closed at task time, the way the mechanical gates enforce at merge time. Repo quirks stay repo-scoped and never leak.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
